<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Injection Process Algorithm</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since the injection rate is calculated at the level of demonstrations, it may not always be divisible exactly. Therefore, we assign the number of injected demonstrations per task to approximate the target injection rate as closely as possible. This design ensures that all tasks are embedded with the backdoor. Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In Appendix E Injection Process Algorithm ‣ Goal-oriented Backdoor Attack against Vision-Language-Action Models via Physical Objects" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> implements this strategy by allocating the maximum possible number of malicious demonstrations to each task without exceeding the specified upper bound.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Inject Malicious Demonstration</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Injection rate <span id="algorithm1.4.1.2" class="ltx_text">IR</span>, LIBERO dataset <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math>, BadLIBERO dataset <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math>, total tasks <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Poisoned dataset <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{X}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{X}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{total}}\leftarrow\text{sum}(\mathcal{X})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>sum</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{total}}\leftarrow\text{sum}(\mathcal{X})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Total number of clean demons across all tasks </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"><math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{total}\leftarrow\text{int}\!\left(\frac{\text{IR}\times n_{\text{total}}}{1-\text{IR}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.136em;" width="1.136em"><mtext>int</mtext></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>IR</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>IR</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{total}\leftarrow\text{int}\!\left(\frac{\text{IR}\times n_{\text{total}}}{1-\text{IR}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Total number of malicious demons to inject (rounded to int) </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.5.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.5.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{i}\leftarrow\text{sum}(\mathcal{X}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>sum</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{i}\leftarrow\text{sum}(\mathcal{X}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Number of clean demonstrations for task <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{i}\leftarrow n_{i}/n_{\text{total}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{i}\leftarrow n_{i}/n_{\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Relative weight of task <math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> (fraction of total clean demos) </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{i}\leftarrow m_{total}\times w_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{i}\leftarrow m_{total}\times w_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Allocation of malicious demos to task <math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{m}_{i}\leftarrow\text{int}\!\left(\frac{\text{IR}\times n_{i}}{1-\text{IR}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.136em;" width="1.136em"><mtext>int</mtext></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>IR</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>IR</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{m}_{i}\leftarrow\text{int}\!\left(\frac{\text{IR}\times n_{i}}{1-\text{IR}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Number of malicious demos given IR, rounded to int </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{i}\leftarrow\min(m_{i},\hat{m}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{i}\leftarrow\min(m_{i},\hat{m}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Cap allocation so it does not exceed per-task target </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{X}^{\prime}_{i}\leftarrow\mathcal{X}_{i}\cup\text{RandomSample}(\mathcal{P},m_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mtext>RandomSample</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{X}^{\prime}_{i}\leftarrow\mathcal{X}_{i}\cup\text{RandomSample}(\mathcal{P},m_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Inject <math id="algorithm1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> random malicious demos (sampled from <math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math>) into task <math id="algorithm1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.12.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{X}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{X}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math></em>

